# Build context is the REPOSITORY ROOT (services/matcher/Dockerfile, design D5),
# so everything the image does not need is excluded here. The image needs only
# pyproject.toml, uv.lock and services/matcher/{pyproject.toml,src}; the
# catalogue is mounted at runtime, never baked in.
.git
.gitignore
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.venv
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
data/
spikes/
openspec/
docs/
scripts/
.codegraph/
.atl/
services/matcher/tests/
frontend/
